:: Passout park
당신은 무리했다.
<br><br>
<<passout>>
<<set $bus to "park">>

<<if dangerEvent()>>
	<<if random(1, 100) gte 81>>
		<<link [[일어난다|Abduction]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $monster is 1 or $settings.bestialityEnabled>>
			<<link [[일어난다|Dog Park]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[일어난다|Dog Park 2]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<ambulance>>
<</if>>

<<pass 1 hour>>

<<trauma 6>><<set $stress -= 2000>>

:: Dog Park
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
    <<set $molestationstart to 0>>
    <<controlloss>>
    <<violence 1>>
    <<neutral 1>>
    <<molested>>
    <<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
    <<beastCombatInit>>
    정신을 차려보니 이상한 <<beasttype>>에게 덤불 뒤로 끌려가고 있다.
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate 1>>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 0>>
    <<set $alarm to 0>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
        <span id="next"><<link [[다음|Dog Park Ejaculation]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
    <<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
        <span id="next"><<link [[다음|Dog Park Escape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
    <<else>>
        <span id="next"><<link [[다음|Dog Park]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
    <</if>>

<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
    <span id="next"><<link [[다음|Dog Park Ejaculation]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
    <span id="next"><<link [[다음|Dog Park Escape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
    <span id="next"><<link [[다음|Dog Park]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Dog Park 2
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>

정신을 차려보니 이상한 <<beasttype>>에게 덤불 뒤로 끌려가고 있다.
<br><br>

당신은 간신히 몸부림쳐 빠져나왔지만, 상처 없이 벗어나지는 못했다. <<beastescape>>
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<set $stress -= 1000>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
<<destination>>

